# Domain → ark-studio.app (301, preserves path)
https://david-liu.pages.dev/* https://ark-studio.app/:splat 301
https://*.david-liu.pages.dev/* https://ark-studio.app/:splat 301
https://www.ark-studio.app/* https://ark-studio.app/:splat 301

# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback
# All routes should return index.html for Vue Router to handle
# (assets must 404 instead — never serve HTML for missing hashed files)
/assets/* /assets/:splat 200
/* /index.html 200
